2025

## Discover Dordrecht's Museums: Art, History and Heritage

Find out what beautiful historical Dordrecht has to offer and which places are worth a visit! In the medieval city centre there are three museums which are worth a visit, all in walking distance:

**Dordrechts Museum** - 6 centuries of Dutch art with a permanent collection and temporary exhibitions.  
[**Huis Van Gijn**](https://www.huisvangijn.nl/english/) - step back into the 19th century and see how upstairs and downstairs lived and worked.  
[**Hof van Nederland**](https://www.hofvannederland.nl/english/) - a historical museum in which you experience how we, in the Netherlands, deal with our freedoms, then and now, told from different perspectives. For children there is a ball pool, an escape game and a special Griffioen tour.

## Discover Two Museums in Dordrecht with One Day Ticket

Tip: book a [day ticket](https://webshophethofvannederland.recreatex.be/Exhibitions/Register?ID=FC692009-DE18-EF11-A2ED-A24EFADD6278) with which you can visit 2 museums on one day.

